WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.684 --> 00:00:07.764
Every powerful technology reaches a moment when its builders and

2
00:00:07.764 --> 00:00:10.344
its government sit down together.

3
00:00:11.284 --> 00:00:18.104
For SI, September 29, 2026, may turn out to be one of those moments.

4
00:00:18.804 --> 00:00:25.704
Rivals signed the same page. The technology got a new name, and the government a new front door.

5
00:00:26.297 --> 00:00:31.224
The accord is voluntary, and critics say voluntary isn't enough.

6
00:00:31.604 --> 00:00:35.284
Supporters say it's a start, one that can grow into something

7
00:00:35.284 --> 00:00:36.264
stronger.

8
00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:45.064
What is clear: the people building the most powerful SI systems are beginning to coordinate with government about what comes next.

9
00:00:45.604 --> 00:00:49.784
What they do with that start is the part history will judge.
